<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Coimbra RP | Regulamento</title>

<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}

body{
    min-height:100vh;
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    background:#050505;
    color:white;
}

body:before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    z-index:-1;
    background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,rgba(255,0,0,.35),transparent 40%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%,rgba(130,0,0,.2),transparent 35%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 100% 70%,rgba(180,0,0,.18),transparent 35%);
}

.container{
    width:min(1000px,92%);
    margin:auto;
    padding:25px 0 60px;
}

.voltar{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:13px 21px;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:bold;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a00000,#350000);
    border:1px solid #ff2020;
    border-radius:10px;
    transition:.3s;
}

.voltar:hover{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,0,0,.5);
}

.cabecalho{
    text-align:center;
    margin:35px 0 45px;
}

.logo{
    width:min(75vw,380px);
    max-height:380px;
    object-fit:contain;
    filter:drop-shadow(0 0 15px red)
           drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(255,0,0,.6));
    animation:brilho 3s infinite;
}

@keyframes brilho{
    0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}
    50%{transform:scale(1.04)}
}

.nome{
    color:#ff2020;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:bold;
    letter-spacing:6px;
}

h1{
    margin-top:10px;
    font-size:clamp(32px,8vw,58px);
    text-shadow:0 0 12px red,0 0 30px rgba(255,0,0,.7);
}

.subtitulo{
    margin-top:10px;
    color:#999;
}

.titulo{
    margin-bottom:22px;
}

.titulo h2{
    padding-left:14px;
    border-left:4px solid #ff2020;
    font-size:27px;
}

.titulo p{
    margin-top:8px;
    color:#888;
}

.categorias{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:18px;
}

.categoria{
    min-height:170px;
    padding:25px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,#1b1b1b,#070707);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,0,0,.3);
    border-radius:18px;
    transition:.3s;
}

.categoria:hover{
    transform:translateY(-7px);
    border-color:#ff2020;
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,#3b0000,#080808);
    box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,0,0,.3);
}

.icone{
    font-size:40px;
    margin-bottom:12px;
}

.categoria strong{
    font-size:18px;
}

.categoria span{
    margin-top:8px;
    color:#888;
    font-size:12px;
}

.rodape{
    margin-top:50px;
    padding-top:25px;
    text-align:center;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,0,0,.15);
    color:#666;
    font-size:12px;
}

.rodape strong{color:#ff2020}

@media(max-width:650px){
    .categorias{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .logo{width:78vw}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<main class="container">

<a href="index.html" class="voltar">← VOLTAR AO INÍCIO</a>

<header class="cabecalho">

<img src="logo.png" alt="Coimbra RP" class="logo">

<div class="nome">COIMBRA RP</div>

<h1>📜 REGULAMENTO</h1>

<p class="subtitulo">
Regulamento Oficial do Coimbra RP
</p>

</header>

<section>

<div class="titulo">
<h2>🔴 REGRAS</h2>
<p>Seleciona uma categoria para consultar o respetivo regulamento.</p>
</div>

<div class="categorias">

<a href="regras-servidor.html" class="categoria">
<div class="icone">🛡️</div>
<strong>Regras do Servidor</strong>
<span>Regras gerais da comunidade</span>
</a>

<a href="regras-roleplay.html" class="categoria">
<div class="icone">🎭</div>
<strong>Regras do Roleplay</strong>
<span>Regras oficiais de RP</span>
</a>

<a href="regras-safezone.html" class="categoria">
<div class="icone">🔴</div>
<strong>Regras da Safe Zone</strong>
<span>Regulamento das zonas seguras</span>
</a>

<a href="regras-organizacoes.html" class="categoria">
<div class="icone">🏢</div>
<strong>Regras das Organizações</strong>
<span>Regulamento das organizações</span>
</a>

<a href="regras-trabalhos.html" class="categoria">
<div class="icone">💼</div>
<strong>Regras dos Trabalhos</strong>
<span>Regulamento dos trabalhos</span>
</a>

<a href="regras-conducao.html" class="categoria">
<div class="icone">🚗</div>
<strong>Regras da Condução</strong>
<span>Regulamento de condução</span>
</a>

</div>
</section>

<footer class="rodape">
© 2026 <strong>Coimbra RP</strong> — Regulamento Oficial
</footer>

</main>

</body>
</html>